---
title: "discord_bot_sync (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_session: server action invoked (admin context)
    q_check_session --> q_error_unauth: no authenticated session
    q_check_session --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return error
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: checkAdmin() returns false
    q_check_admin --> q_determine_op: user is admin
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return 403 forbidden
    q_determine_op --> q_sync_single: operation = sync single member roles
    q_determine_op --> q_sync_all: operation = sync all member roles
    q_determine_op --> q_update_nickname: operation = update nickname
    q_determine_op --> q_check_status: operation = check member status
    q_sync_single --> q_call_bot_single: POST /api/roles/sync with Bearer token
    q_call_bot_single --> q_log_result: response received
    q_call_bot_single --> q_log_error: request failed (fire-and-forget)
    q_sync_all --> q_call_bot_all: POST /api/roles/sync-all with Bearer token
    q_call_bot_all --> q_log_result: response received
    q_call_bot_all --> q_log_error: request failed (fire-and-forget)
    q_update_nickname --> q_call_bot_nick: POST /api/nickname/update with Bearer token
    q_call_bot_nick --> q_log_result: response received
    q_call_bot_nick --> q_log_error: request failed (fire-and-forget)
    q_check_status --> q_call_bot_status: GET /api/member/status with Bearer token
    q_call_bot_status --> q_return_status: return DiscordMemberStatus (is_in_server, current_nickname, current_roles)
    q_call_bot_status --> q_log_error: request failed
    q_log_result --> [*]: return success
    q_log_error --> [*]: log error, do not fail parent mutation
    q_return_status --> [*]: return member status

    note right of q_call_bot_single
        INV-001: Discord bot API calls use Bearer token auth (STEM_BOT_API_BEARER_TOKEN)
        INV-002: sync/nickname calls are fire-and-forget (errors logged, not propagated)
    end note

    note right of q_check_status
        INV-003: member status check returns is_in_server boolean for Discord server membership verification
    end note
